---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
---

<Legal
  title="Privacy policy"
  description="Hosted Pro is currently waitlist. Self-hosted: your mail never touches our servers. When checkout opens, Hosted Pro customer data is used only to provide and support the service."
>
  <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
  <p class="updated">Effective September 6, 2026</p>

  <p class="lede">
    The short version: when you self-host openagent.email, your mail data stays on your server.
    Hosted Pro is currently waitlist. When checkout opens, we will use customer and order
    information only to provide and support the service. This website uses no tracking cookies.
  </p>

  <h2>The software</h2>
  <p>
    openagent.email is self-hosted. Every mailbox, message, and token lives on infrastructure you
    own and control. The software contains no telemetry, no analytics, and no "phone home"
    behavior of any kind. We never see your mail — we couldn't if we wanted to.
  </p>

  <h2>This website</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      To join the Hosted Pro waitlist, you can email
      <a href="mailto:support@openagent.email?subject=Hosted%20Pro%20waitlist">support@openagent.email</a>
      with the subject Hosted Pro waitlist. We use that address only to manage the waitlist and
      reply when a slot opens.
    </li>
    <li>
      When checkout opens, Hosted Pro checkout will collect the email address used for the order
      and the requested openagent.email address prefix. We will use them to create, provision, and
      support your hosted instance.
    </li>
    <li>
      You can contact
      <a href="mailto:support@openagent.email">support@openagent.email</a>. We use the address
      only to provide support and reply to the request.
    </li>
    <li>No advertising, no third-party trackers, no cross-site tracking.</li>
    <li>
      We use <a href="https://umami.is/">Umami</a>, a privacy-focused analytics tool, hosted on
      our own server. It records anonymous, aggregate page-view statistics (which pages are
      visited, roughly where from, and what kind of device). It sets no cookies, stores no IP
      addresses, and cannot identify you.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Hosted Pro</h2>
  <p>
    Our optional hosted service is for people who don't want to run their own server. Hosted Pro
    is currently waitlist. When checkout opens and you make a one-time purchase, the following
    will apply:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      On the hosted service, your mailboxes will live on servers we operate. We will access them
      only to run, secure, and troubleshoot the service. We never read your mail for advertising, never
      sell your data, and never share it except with the infrastructure and payment providers
      needed to deliver the service.
    </li>
    <li>
      When checkout opens, Creem will be our Merchant of Record and payment processor. It will
      process your payment and billing information under its own privacy policy; we will never see
      or store your full card details.
    </li>
    <li>You will be able to export your data and delete your account at any time.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>If you email us</h2>
  <p>
    If you write to <a href="mailto:support@openagent.email">support@openagent.email</a>, we use
    your address only to reply to you. We don't add it to marketing lists, sell it, or share it.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-party services</h2>
  <p>
    Our source code is hosted on GitHub and our packages are distributed via the npm registry.
    When you use those services, their own privacy policies apply.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    If this policy changes, we'll update this page and the effective date above. Questions?
    Email <a href="mailto:support@openagent.email">support@openagent.email</a>.
  </p>
</Legal>
